{"audio": "romans-07.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 189067, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1467, "text": "Romans, Chapter Seven."}, {"start_ms": 1467, "end_ms": 9067, "text": "Know ye not, brethren, (for I speak to them that know the law,) how that the law hath dominion over a man as long as he liveth?"}, {"start_ms": 9067, "end_ms": 18933, "text": "For the woman which hath an husband is bound by the law to her husband so long as he liveth; but if the husband be dead, she is loosed from the law of her husband."}, {"start_ms": 18933, "end_ms": 32667, "text": "So then if, while her husband liveth, she be married to another man, she shall be called an adulteress: but if her husband be dead, she is free from that law; so that she is no adulteress, though she be married to another man."}, {"start_ms": 32667, "end_ms": 44000, "text": "Wherefore, my brethren, ye also are become dead to the law by the body of Christ; that ye should be married to another, even to him who is raised from the dead, that we should bring forth fruit unto God."}, {"start_ms": 44000, "end_ms": 51600, "text": "For when we were in the flesh, the motions of sins, which were by the law, did work in our members to bring forth fruit unto death."}, {"start_ms": 51600, "end_ms": 60533, "text": "But now we are delivered from the law, that being dead wherein we were held; that we should serve in newness of spirit, and not in the oldness of the letter."}, {"start_ms": 60533, "end_ms": 62267, "text": "What shall we say then?"}, {"start_ms": 62267, "end_ms": 64267, "text": "Is the law sin?"}, {"start_ms": 64267, "end_ms": 65067, "text": "God forbid."}, {"start_ms": 65067, "end_ms": 72533, "text": "Nay, I had not known sin, but by the law: for I had not known lust, except the law had said, Thou shalt not covet."}, {"start_ms": 72533, "end_ms": 78533, "text": "But sin, taking occasion by the commandment, wrought in me all manner of concupiscence."}, {"start_ms": 78533, "end_ms": 81067, "text": "For without the law sin was dead."}, {"start_ms": 81067, "end_ms": 88000, "text": "For I was alive without the law once: but when the commandment came, sin revived, and I died."}, {"start_ms": 88000, "end_ms": 92000, "text": "And the commandment, which was ordained to life, I found to be unto death."}, {"start_ms": 92000, "end_ms": 98267, "text": "For sin, taking occasion by the commandment, deceived me, and by it slew me."}, {"start_ms": 98267, "end_ms": 102800, "text": "Wherefore the law is holy, and the commandment holy, and just, and good."}, {"start_ms": 102800, "end_ms": 105333, "text": "Was then that which is good made death unto me?"}, {"start_ms": 105333, "end_ms": 106533, "text": "God forbid."}, {"start_ms": 106533, "end_ms": 114800, "text": "But sin, that it might appear sin, working death in me by that which is good; that sin by the commandment might become exceeding sinful."}, {"start_ms": 114800, "end_ms": 119867, "text": "For we know that the law is spiritual: but I am carnal, sold under sin."}, {"start_ms": 119867, "end_ms": 127467, "text": "For that which I do I allow not: for what I would, that do I not; but what I hate, that do I."}, {"start_ms": 127467, "end_ms": 132000, "text": "If then I do that which I would not, I consent unto the law that it is good."}, {"start_ms": 132000, "end_ms": 136267, "text": "Now then it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me."}, {"start_ms": 136267, "end_ms": 146267, "text": "For I know that in me (that is, in my flesh,) dwelleth no good thing: for to will is present with me; but how to perform that which is good I find not."}, {"start_ms": 146267, "end_ms": 152000, "text": "For the good that I would I do not: but the evil which I would not, that I do."}, {"start_ms": 152000, "end_ms": 156533, "text": "Now if I do that I would not, it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me."}, {"start_ms": 156533, "end_ms": 162533, "text": "I find then a law, that, when I would do good, evil is present with me."}, {"start_ms": 162533, "end_ms": 175733, "text": "For I delight in the law of God after the inward man: But I see another law in my members, warring against the law of my mind, and bringing me into captivity to the law of sin which is in my members."}, {"start_ms": 175733, "end_ms": 178133, "text": "O wretched man that I am!"}, {"start_ms": 178133, "end_ms": 181067, "text": "who shall deliver me from the body of this death?"}, {"start_ms": 181067, "end_ms": 183200, "text": "I thank God through Jesus Christ our Lord."}, {"start_ms": 183200, "end_ms": 189067, "text": "So then with the mind I myself serve the law of God; but with the flesh the law of sin."}], "words": [{"t": "Romans,", "s": 402, "e": 723, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 784, "e": 1085, "si": 0}, {"t": "Seven.", "s": 1145, "e": 1427, "si": 0}, {"t": "Know", "s": 1868, "e": 2008, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 2049, "e": 2109, "si": 1}, {"t": "not,", "s": 2189, "e": 2349, "si": 1}, {"t": "brethren,", "s": 2409, "e": 2790, "si": 1}, {"t": "(for", "s": 3412, "e": 3512, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 3633, "e": 3653, "si": 1}, {"t": "speak", "s": 3733, "e": 3974, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 4014, "e": 4094, "si": 1}, {"t": "them", "s": 4134, "e": 4294, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 4355, "e": 4495, "si": 1}, {"t": "know", "s": 4535, "e": 4716, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4756, "e": 4856, "si": 1}, {"t": "law,)", "s": 4916, "e": 5157, "si": 1}, {"t": "how", "s": 5738, "e": 5859, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 5899, "e": 6039, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6059, "e": 6139, "si": 1}, {"t": "law", "s": 6199, "e": 6360, "si": 1}, {"t": "hath", "s": 6440, "e": 6621, "si": 1}, {"t": "dominion", "s": 6681, "e": 7142, "si": 1}, {"t": "over", "s": 7242, "e": 7443, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 7503, "e": 7523, "si": 1}, {"t": "man", "s": 7583, "e": 7864, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 7944, "e": 8044, "si": 1}, {"t": "long", "s": 8125, "e": 8325, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 8365, "e": 8465, "si": 1}, {"t": "he", "s": 8485, "e": 8566